Running the Project on Windows

1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/SriyaVinukonda/AI-Financial-Fraud-Detection.git

2. Open the project
cd AI-Financial-Fraud-Detection

3. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

4. Run the application
.\run_windows.bat

The first run may download the public dataset and train the machine learning model, so it may take several minutes.

5. Open the dashboard
Open:
http://127.0.0.1:8000
